        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aaron Latham, James Bridges, John Travolta\n- Works: Urban Cowboy, Urban Chipmunk, Boot Scootin' Boogie, Saturday Night Fever, Grease\n- Groups: Alvin and the Chipmunks\n\nFacts:\n- Aaron Latham was born on October 3, 1943, and he is an American journalist.\n- Aaron Latham wrote the article that inspired the 1980 film Urban Cowboy.\n- Aaron Latham co-wrote the script for Urban Cowboy with director James Bridges.\n- Urban Cowboy was John Travolta's third major acting role after Saturday Night Fever and Grease.\n- Urban Chipmunk parodies the 1980 movie Urban Cowboy in its title.\n- Alvin and the Chipmunks released a cover of Boot Scootin' Boogie in their signature style for the 1993 re-release of Urban Chipmunk.",
